  m_text: 'Press E or <sprite name="Button_6"> to perform a basic weapon attack.


    While
    jumping, press W or <sprite name="Button_7"> to perform a plunge attack.


    Press
    Q or <sprite name="SpellButton_0"> to cast a spell.


    Press Space or <sprite
    name="Button_4"> to jump and doublejump.


    Some weapons can perform a heavy
    attack by holding it''s ability button.


    If you have 2 weapons, press 1
    or weapon icon  to swap weapons.

    If you have 2 spells, press 2 or  spell
    icon to swap spells.'
